{"id": 1005438, "slug": "spirit-x-strike", "name": "Spirit X Strike", "name_original": "Spirit X Strike", "description": "<p>Experience a fresh take on this action adventure of  \"Spirit X Strike,\" featuring three intertwined combat systems: Instant Counter, Super Strike, and Spirit Mimicry. Players can swiftly switch between defense and attack, and experience an adrenaline-pumping combat.</p><p> </p><ul><li><p>Unique Action storing and release system to break the limits of COMBO potential!</p></li></ul><p>Chain together action sequences using the game’s distinctive Spirit Mimicry. This system allows you to freely assemble moves and unleash them at the moment you desire. Even newcomers can easily execute stunning combos and air-juggle confirms.</p><ul><li><p>It’s Strike Time!</p></li></ul><p>Break your opponents’ defense with well-timed counters and quick pressure, then execute them with the finishing \"Super Strike\". There are a lot of different “Super Strike” finishers for different situations waiting for you to try out!</p><p> </p><ul><li><p>Survival in Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland</p></li></ul><p>Play as Carter, the inheritor of the Spirit Fist, and face off against top warriors in the Wasteland. Unearth your limitless potential and \"Strike\" your way through!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-06-19", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-06-23T08:57:11", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b5a/b5aa2d4e1c89219b4d7ff7afdf2a808a.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/558/5583d384568b7b1c62a86bd14f716d4b.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_coun