ifferent “Super Strike” finishers for different situations waiting for you to try out! Survival in Post-Apocalyptic WastelandPlay as Carter, the inheritor of the Spirit Fist, and face off against top warriors in the Wasteland. Unearth your limitless potential and \"Strike\" your way through!"}